{"path":"experimental/basic_string/erase_if","title":"std::experimental::erase_if (std::basic_string)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::</span>erase_if <small>(std::basic_string)</small>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/basic_string/erase_if","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Erases all elements that satisfy the predicate pred from the container. Equivalent to c.erase(std::remove_if(c.begin(), c.end(), pred), c.end());.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code>&lt;experimental/string&gt;</code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Traits, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Alloc, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Pred <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> erase_if<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1236\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits, Alloc<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> c, Pred pred <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts-2 t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS v2)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Erases all elements that satisfy the predicate <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pred</span></code> from the container. Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c.<span class=\"me1\">erase</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/remove\"><span class=\"kw1604\"